      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{644b8aedc1015a09063a52c2|full_name}: Is facial actually used in the context of porn? I thought it'd be a category over on p⚫rnhub, but it doesn't appear to be one. \n\nMeanwhile https://business.vive.com/us/product/vive-facial-tracker/\n\nMaybe it makes more sense in the original klingon, but as a native English speaker, face->artist seems weird to the point of drawing attention. Misspell superficial? might learn about an NSFW term :)\n\ncunt->cant is subtle\n\nshit->poop doesn't really touch the meaning that much\n\ncialis->motrin appear to be brands in the land of USA-chan, maybe its spam related? I googled cialis and a log of pages are saying Tadalafil  which does not appear to be censored.",
